      "text": [
        "1464 - وَ كَانَ عَلِيٌّ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ يَأْكُلُ يَوْمَ اَلْفِطْرِ قَبْلَ أَنْ يَغْدُوَ إِلَى اَلْمُصَلَّى وَ لاَ يَأْكُلُ يَوْمَ اَلْأَضْحَى حَتَّى يَذْبَحَ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1464 - Imam Ali (as) would eat on the day of Eid al-Fitr before heading to the prayer area, but on the day of Eid al-Adha, he would not eat until after performing the ritual sacrifice."
        ]
      }
